{"id":2090,"level":80,"name":"Відкритий напад (4)","group":"Відкритий напад","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>The discovered attack remains one of the most powerful weapons in chess. By moving a piece and revealing an attack, you create a situation where multiple opposing pieces come under pressure. A discovered attack is particularly effective because you essentially set up two threats simultaneously. As the front piece moves, it opens the attack of a rook, queen, or bishop behind it.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":103,"examples":[{"fen":"r1b1k2r/p3qp1p/2pb1p2/2p5/4P2P/5Q2/PpP2PP1/1K1R2NR w kq - 0 14","pgn":"{[%evp 0,5,-14,0,0,0,0,0]} 14. e5 {[%csl Ra8,Rc6,Rd6,Ge5,Re8,Gf3]} Bxe5 15. Qxc6+ Kf8 16. Qxa8 * ","text":"<p>Просуваючи пішака електронних шахів, білі відкривають важливу діагональ для білого ферзя. Чорний не може уникнути втрати матеріалу.</p><p><br></p>","format":27},{"fen":"4rrk1/1b2qppp/p7/1p6/4Np2/2P2P2/PP4PP/3RRQ1K w - - 0 23","pgn":"{[%evp 0,5,531,563,572,587,590,604]} 23. Nd6 {[%csl Gd1,Gd6,Ge1,Re7,Re8,Gf1][%cal Gd6e8,Ge1e7,Ge1e8,Gd1d6,Gf1e1,Gd1e1]} Qxe1 24. Rxe1 Rxe1 25. Qxe1 * ","text":"<p>Білий кінь стрибає вперед, що забезпечує чудову координацію між білими фігурами. Білі виграють розмін.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77762,"fen":"2r4r/p4kpp/3pbq2/1pp1P3/3P4/5N2/PP1Q2PP/2KR3R b - - 0 17","pgn":"{[%csl Rc1][%evp 0,3,-225,-179,-151,-108]} {Q=1} 17... cxd4+ 18. Kb1 {Q=2} dxe5 (18... Bf5+ 19. Ka1 dxe5) * ","format":27,"texts":["Білий король викритий.","Виграти пішака."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77765,"fen":"3r1rk1/ppq1b1pp/4p3/2P2p2/PP1n4/3Q1B1P/3B1PP1/2R1R1K1 b - - 0 24","pgn":"{[%csl Rd3][%evp 0,3,-242,-245,-257,-248]} {Q=1} 24... Nxf3+ 25. Qxf3 {Q=2} Rxd2 * ","format":27,"texts":["Your knight and rook form a strong duo.","Безкоштовна фігура доступна!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77770,"fen":"r2q1rk1/pp1b1pp1/2n2